# cocotbext-sva

SystemVerilog-style immediate and concurrent (temporal) assertions for
[cocotb](https://www.cocotb.org) testbenches, written in SVA syntax and checked
by a fast compiled engine. Works with VHDL and Verilog designs.

Status: in development, not released. See `docs/design.md`.
